  "description": "Mokdan, an orphaned woodcutter woman living bravely off her strength, saves a trapped deer. In return, the deer leads her to a secluded mountain pond to find her a husband—where she encounters celestial youths bathing. In the chaos, Mokdan ends up stealing the winged robe of one heavenly youth, Gonghwa, setting an unexpected fate in motion.\nSource: MU",
